# The player

The music player (0.42.0): a record's tracks on one persistent player — a
streaming row plays in place, a locked row links to the record's buy door —
and the one-row now-playing strip.

::player[title="Time Traveler" artist="Scouter" art="/img/time-traveler.png" buy="#buy" buy-label="Full album"]
- Broken Hearted | 1:55 | | Chapter 1 · Ordinary World
- Where the Cold Wind Blows | 2:06 | locked
- Time Traveler | 2:54 | /audio/time-traveler.mp3 | Chapter 4 · Meeting the Mentor
- Without Rain | 3:16 | https://cdn.example.com/without-rain.mp3
::

::player[layout=row title="Time Traveler" artist="Scouter" line="The title track streams free. The record is $9.99." buy="/music/time-traveler#buy" buy-label="Buy the album"]
- Time Traveler | 2:54 | /audio/time-traveler.mp3
::

